[[File:Binding Chains debuff.png|thumb]]

'''Binding Chains''' is a [[debuff]] that reduces the [[movement speed]] of the character, inflicting 20% reduced Movement Speed.

Teleporting with any movement skill that instantly moves you (such as {{il|Flame Dash}} or {{il|Blink Arrow}}) instantly removes all stacks of the Binding Chains debuff. {{il|The Stampede}} can bypass the penalty of the vines entirely.

This debuff is only found in the [[Forbidden Sanctum]] while under the effect of the "Chains of Binding" Affliction, which causes monsters to inflict it on hit.

